Arizona QSO Party, for Arizona entrants: the 50 US states, the 13 Canadian provinces and territories, and DXCC countries as the DX multiplier.
Each of the 15 Arizona counties counts as the state Arizona (an Arizona station works Arizona stations too), so each county maps to Az.
The counties come first, so a county code wins over a state or province alias spelled the same.
APH > Az=APH,^Apache
CHS > Az=CHS,^Cochise
CNO > Az=CNO,^Coconino
GLA > Az=GLA,^Gila
GHM > Az=GHM,^Graham
GLE > Az=GLE,^Greenlee
LPZ > Az=LPZ,^La Paz
MCP > Az=MCP,^Maricopa
MHV > Az=MHV,^Mohave
NVO > Az=NVO,^Navajo
PMA > Az=PMA,^Pima
PNL > Az=PNL,^Pinal
SCZ > Az=SCZ,^Santa Cruz
YVP > Az=YVP,^Yavapai
YMA > Az=YMA,^Yuma
